	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9218"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236" title="View the profile of Gonaiel">Gonaiel</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 73<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/demon1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=236"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=912.msg9218#msg9218"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=912.msg9218#msg9218">Re: (No topic kinda pointless yet redundant topic)</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #1 on:</b> July 10, 2004, 02:47:31 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							So let me get this straight we should vote for John Kerry becuse he changes his stance on everything just to get votes, more then once at that.&nbsp; He has thrown medals he was awarded for military excellence( not political excellence ) on stage in protest for political reasons, in doing so slapping every military member in the face that have died for others to wear those medals and there uniform with pride.&nbsp; He voted agaisnt getting the military better items by voting no to a 86 billion dollar fund for the millitary.&nbsp; The marines themselves get all the hand me downs from everyone else.&nbsp; Heck I just turned in my kevlar and flag jacket that were from the 70&#039;s to 80&#039;s range due to me getting out of the Marines and I finally get a much needed raise Thanks to Mr. Bush.&nbsp; What do you think will happen to my crappy pay check if John Kerry gets voted in ?&nbsp; Right back down to nothing again.&nbsp; In a week I spend about 80 hours working I&#039;m sure there are plenty more out there that work way more then me that are in the military.&nbsp; Do the math after taxes I make about 16k to 17k a year working 80 hours a week with no overtime and tell me how much I get an hour.&nbsp; <br /><br />The reason people want Bush out of office is not becuse he is doing so bad in office but becuse he poses a threat to the Democrats.&nbsp; That was seen durning the election for the house and senate seats when the GoP took over the majority of both the house and the senate, something that is almost never heard of.&nbsp; He poses a threat to their style of thinking IE. School pray, Abortion, Gay marrage, Religion...ect.&nbsp; The eco9nmoy of George w. Bush wont be felt untill the next 4 years do to the trickle down effect, meaning that someone cannot change something overnight.&nbsp; It doesn&#039;t happen, I can not go into a company and make it an overnight success, these things takes time and patience.&nbsp; The war in Iraq removed one of the worlds most ruthless leaders ( killing his onw country men and women and children on a reagular basis) not to mention Bin Laden had to get supplies and money from somewhere and he isn&#039;t that rich nether is his country.&nbsp; On that same note you blame Bush for not being able to capture Bin Laden where ever he is hiding, But Bill clinton had him delivered to him on a siliver platter but a few countries and didn&#039;t do anything about it.&nbsp; So who is to blame about 9-11 Bill Clinton,&nbsp; He could have taken Bin laden and 9-11 would have never happened.&nbsp; <br /><br />Then ask yourself this, where does the us get its oil from they don&#039;t buy it from the countries it&#039;s self but from a major company(sorry I can&#039;t remember the company&#039;s name at this time if someone else can please share it) that has oil fields all over the world.&nbsp; Most of the Gas and Oil companies that we buy our gas from is are world wide companies that do not do bisness souly in the US.&nbsp; There are only a few that do and only buy oil from USA soil and not from foriegn markets.&nbsp; The US Government can only do so much in bring gas prices down.&nbsp; If you want to see them go down only buy Gas from companies that buy their oil from US soil drilled.&nbsp; Then you will see the prices go down do to the foriegn markets being forced to lower their prices.&nbsp; If you really want to know how to bring Jobs and money in tap the black gold in alaska or find a new means of energy that we can use in lue of oil and gas.&nbsp; <br /><br />People blame Bush for jobs being lost in america and having them go to foriegners.&nbsp; That one is kinda our fualt to seeing as we do the hiring ( if your in that postion).&nbsp; People would rather hire someone that will work for jack and shit compaired to a US person that will want more money easy as that.&nbsp; If Immagrints ( illegal types)&nbsp; can&#039;t find work here if they don&#039;t possess the proper items needed to be legal, then they wont get the jobs.&nbsp; That would give more jobs to Americans.&nbsp; <br /><br />Most of the problems we have, we as US people can fix on our own.&nbsp; We depend on the US goverment to hand us everything and to do the work for us.&nbsp; It&#039;s not the Goverments job to hand you a job and to give you money.&nbsp; We would rather deny the Military better equipment and funding for Military members that bust there arses off to keep this country free but becuse it would cost the tax payers money John Kerry says no.&nbsp; Yet we have welfare to people on the majority that don&#039;t work for crap and are to lazy to get out of the house to get a job or a better one ( mind you there are people that do work hard and struggle due to situations ).&nbsp; Why don&#039;t we make people get a Job by cutting welfare after a certain amount of time if they aren&#039;t holding there end of the bargain up IE. having to get positive progress reports in order to keep getting you welfare check, that would allow people that do truely work hard earn they money that the goverment would provide for them to help them get a leg up.&nbsp; Then the people that do jack and shit would get nothing becuse they don&#039;t want to work for it and thats what they would get jack and shit.<br /><br />Free medical care would cost the tax payers millions and we still wouldn&#039;t get good health care for those that can&#039;t afford it.&nbsp; As a doctor you more then likely wouldn&#039;t work as hard if you had thousands of people&nbsp; waiting for free health care and you were getting paid crap for it, not to mention there isn&#039;t as many doctors out there as there needs to be in the first place.&nbsp; So you would then have to higher more people there for to keep up with the market and pressure of supply and demand you would then be forced to lower you critera to become a doctor.&nbsp; There for you would have doctors that weren&#039;t very good working on people for for next to&nbsp; crap cash at a free clinic doing a sub par job.<br /><br />People blame Bush for&nbsp; Schools being sub par.&nbsp; This is again something that we as parents and teachers are to blame for.&nbsp; As a parent we need to be in our kids ass all day till the leave home to make sure they are doing there school work, make sure they are attending school,&nbsp; make sure they are doing whats right and to talk to to them about issues that kids have to deal with IE. drugs, sex, smoking...ect.&nbsp; Thats something that kids deal with everyday.&nbsp; It&#039;s hard stuff they deal with at school and if you as a parent don&#039;t talk to you kids about becuse your afraid to then who are you hurting you or you child that looks to you for insight.&nbsp; We have taken punshiment away from parents and called it abuse, like spanking your kid, be it with a belt or other wise for when they do something wrong that rates it( not talking about beating you kid for nothing or punching kicking type of thing).&nbsp; As a kid I got my butt whipped if I did something wrong that was worthly of it.&nbsp; You can bet damn well that I didn&#039;t do that again.&nbsp; People then say thats abuse you can&#039;t do that think of the children.&nbsp; When you take that type of thing away from you kids they no longer fear getting in trouble.&nbsp; Really what are you gonna do to a kid ground them from something,&nbsp; all they are gonna do is say I can do what I want what are you gonna do ground me and then ground me again if I don&#039;t follow that.&nbsp; When you got your ass whipped as a kid you feared doing something that would get you parnets mad like that becuse you knew that you wouldn&#039;t sit down for a week.&nbsp; Talk to your kids about issues in their life and don&#039;t let them get away with things that aren&#039;t supposed to be doing.&nbsp; We didn&#039;t have all these problems back in the day when my parents were kids in the 60&#039;s and 70&#039;s but we do know becuse we can&#039;t disapline a kid proplely ( grounding doesn&#039;t work).<br /><br />Anyhow Thats just my option as some won&#039;t agree some will.&nbsp; If you take things and really think about them and not dismiss things becuse they are the devils work you might get an understanding of things and not be so qwick to get offended of things.&nbsp; Any who,&nbsp; Just think about it.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg9230"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=666" title="View the profile of Dalik Geezy">Dalik Geezy</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 38<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/spectre.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=666"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
