								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Neither choice is good.<br /><br />We were talking last night about the Roman Empire and how only the aritocrats (the rich people) were allowed to be members of the senate.<br /><br />Now we have four millionaires vying for power.<br /><br />If its a battle of the millionaires, I&#039;d prefer Ross Perot. He might be a lunatic but it would make for four years of laughs.
