								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							It was in 1995 I *believe*.&nbsp; The RCMP let him slip through, and Mr Chretien&#039;s wife scared him off with the statue.&nbsp; I seriously wonder about our &quot;secret service&quot; sometimes.<br /><br />Ahh politics.&nbsp; So much fun.&nbsp; We had a gay politician here in BC resign because he shoplifted a piece of jewellery at an auction.&nbsp; He confessed.<br /><br />Wasn&#039;t there a politician from NJ who resigned because he was having a gay affair?&nbsp; Props to the man&#039;s wife...&nbsp; 
