								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=912.msg10416#msg10416"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=912.msg10416#msg10416">Re: (No topic kinda pointless yet redundant topic)</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #13 on:</b> August 24, 2004, 11:46:36 am &#187;</span></td>
