							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Meh, a pie in the face versus a woman on her knees.&nbsp; Until we manage to vote a younger PM in we&#039;re never going to have a good sex scandal.&nbsp; There was a little bit of hope with Jack Layton, but alas...&nbsp; 
